# These IDs apply repo-wide, so they also cover any Dockerfile added later.
# Scoping them by path needs .trivyignore.yaml, which Trivy reads only when
# given --ignorefile; neither the local scans nor CI pass that today.

# cli/Dockerfile (the only Dockerfile here) copies verified-binaries/tuf-cache.tgz
# with ADD on purpose: ADD unpacks a local archive itself, and the image has no
# shell step to do it otherwise. No remote URL is involved.
DS-0005

# The scanner image is a CLI that exits after each run, not a service, so a
# HEALTHCHECK has nothing to check.
DS-0026
